<title>USA: First Bank System completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>First Bank System completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bank System Inc said Tuesday it completed the previously announced acquisition of the bond indenture services and paying agency business of Detroit-based Comerica Inc.</p>
<p>First Bank, a large provider of corporate trust services, now serves nearly 10,000 clients with almost 35,000 bond issues, with approximately $500 billion in bonds outstanding.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
